      "at": "2026-08-26T05:27:47.830920Z",
      "owner_directive": "Plan: (1) Add PreviewTab to TabState union with openPreviewTab; preview tab is transient - switchTab auto-closes it, not persisted, no dirty concept. (2) DataPreview maximize button opens preview tab instead of overlay, keeping preview_expanded tutorial event. (3) New backend POST /api/data/register-path (project-relative path, validated inside project root) reusing register_data_ref for type inference; (4) ProjectTree double-click in data root opens preview tab (preview takes priority over editor incl. csv). Right DataPreview panel unchanged. SpecKit N/A (not a new subsystem). ADR N/A (extends ADR-036 tab union and ADR-048 preview routing without altering their decisions).",
